<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>家具布置工作台</title>
<style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#eef2f5;color:#213b46;font:14px/1.6 system-ui,"Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}header{background:#153744;color:#fff;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}h1{font-size:23px;margin:0}header p{font-size:12px;color:#bcd5dc;margin:3px 0}header a{color:#b9e5dd}.badge{margin-left:auto}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:310px minmax(380px,1fr) 270px;height:calc(100vh - 86px)}aside{padding:16px;background:#fff;overflow:auto}aside.left{border-right:1px solid #d1dfe5}aside.right{border-left:1px solid #d1dfe5}section{border-bottom:1px solid #dbe4e8;margin-bottom:16px;padding-bottom:16px}h2{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 9px}button,input,select{font:inherit;color:inherit;border:1px solid #b8cbd3;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;padding:7px 9px}button{cursor:pointer}button:hover{background:#edf6f4}button.primary{background:#176c65;color:#fff;border-color:#176c65}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}input,select{width:100%}input[type=checkbox]{width:auto}button.danger{color:#93453a}.buttons{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}label{font-size:12px;color:#5b7581}label input,label select{margin-top:3px}.hint{font-size:12px;color:#68828e;margin:8px 0}.notice{font-size:12px;background:#fff6e3;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:5px;color:#815f28}main{min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.toolbar{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #d1dfe5;padding:10px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.toolbar label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}.toolbar select{width:auto}.canvas-wrap{flex:1;min-height:360px;position:relative}canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none;background:#edf3f5}.status{padding:8px 14px;background:#deeeea;font-size:12px;min-height:36px}.status.error{background:#fae7e2;color:#93453a}.list{display:grid;gap:6px}.list button{text-align:left;font-size:13px}.list button.active{background:#def0ec;border-color:#217f73}.issue{font-size:12px;padding:8px;margin-top:7px;background:#fff4e1;border-left:3px solid #d6a44e}.issue.ok{background:#eaf4ed;border-color:#5a9a70}#asset-image{width:100%;max-height:160px;object-fit:contain;background:#f2f5f7}#file-json,#file-image{display:none}.tag{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;background:#ebf1f4;color:#58727c;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;margin-right:4px}@media(max-width:1100px){.layout{grid-template-columns:270px minmax(350px,1fr)}aside.right{grid-column:1/-1;max-height:280px}.layout{height:auto}main{min-height:650px}.canvas-wrap{height:540px}}@media(max-width:700px){.layout{display:block}aside.left{max-height:520px}main{min-height:560px}.canvas-wrap{height:440px}header{padding:12px}.badge{margin-left:0}}</style>
</head><body><header><div><h1>家具布置工作台</h1><p id="scope-note"></p></div><a href="__ROOM_URL__">编辑房间与门窗</a><span class="badge" id="room-badge"></span></header>
<div class="layout"><aside class="left">
<section><h2>添加家具</h2><select id="catalog"></select><p class="hint" id="catalog-info"></p><img id="catalog-image" style="width:100%;max-height:150px;object-fit:contain" hidden><a id="catalog-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>查看官方商品与尺寸</a><button id="add" class="primary">添加到房间</button><div class="buttons"><button id="test-desk">加入测试桌椅</button></div><p class="hint">内置模型用于尺寸占位，可按实际商品修改大小。商品外观三维重建尚未接入。</p></section>
<section><h2>当前家具</h2><div id="furniture-list" class="list"></div><p id="empty" class="hint">当前尚未放入家具。</p></section>
<section id="editor-section" hidden><h2>选中家具</h2><label>名称<input id="label"></label><div class="fields"><label>长 X / 米<input id="size-x" type="number" min=".03" step=".01"></label><label>深 Y / 米<input id="size-y" type="number" min=".03" step=".01"></label><label>高度 / 米<input id="size-z" type="number" min=".03" step=".01"></label><label>安装方式<select id="mount"><option value="floor">落地</option><option value="wall">挂墙</option><option value="ceiling">顶装</option></select></label><label>X 中心 / 米<input id="pos-x" type="number" step=".01"></label><label>Y 中心 / 米<input id="pos-y" type="number" step=".01"></label><label>旋转 / 度<input id="rotation" type="number" step="1"></label><label>离地底高 / 米<input id="pos-z" type="number" step=".01"></label></div><div id="wall-fields" class="fields" hidden><label>所属墙<select id="wall"></select></label><label>沿墙中心 / 米<input id="wall-u" type="number" step=".01"></label></div><div class="buttons"><button id="apply" class="primary">应用修改</button><button id="rotate">旋转 90°</button><button id="duplicate">复制</button><button id="remove" class="danger">删除</button></div><img id="asset-image" hidden><a id="product-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>查看商品来源</a><p id="selected-note" class="hint"></p></section>
<section><details><summary>添加自定义家具与参考图</summary><p class="hint">先按尺寸建占位模型，参考图随方案保存。</p><label>家具名称<input id="custom-name" value="自定义家具"></label><div class="fields"><label>长 / 米<input id="custom-x" type="number" step=".01" value=".8"></label><label>深 / 米<input id="custom-y" type="number" step=".01" value=".4"></label><label>高 / 米<input id="custom-z" type="number" step=".01" value=".75"></label><label>默认安装<select id="custom-mount"><option value="floor">落地</option><option value="wall">挂墙</option><option value="ceiling">顶装</option></select></label></div><div class="buttons"><button id="pick-image">选择参考图</button><button id="create-asset">加入家具库</button></div><p id="image-status" class="hint">未选择参考图</p><input id="file-image" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"></details></section>
<section><h2>保存方案</h2><div class="buttons"><button id="undo">撤销</button><button id="redo">重做</button><button id="save" class="primary">导出方案 JSON</button><button id="glb">导出带家具 GLB</button><button id="load">导入方案</button><button id="restore">恢复初始房间</button></div><input id="file-json" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"><p id="save-note" class="hint">修改会尝试保存在当前浏览器的本地草稿中，导出 JSON 可跨页面继续使用。</p></section>
</aside><main><div class="toolbar"><button id="top">俯视摆放</button><button id="iso">3D 轴测</button><button id="reset">重置视角</button><label>操作<select id="mode"><option value="move">拖动家具</option><option value="orbit">旋转视角</option></select></label><label><input id="cutaway" type="checkbox" checked> 剖视墙体</label><label><input id="ceiling" type="checkbox"> 顶面</label><label><input id="zones" type="checkbox" checked> 门前预留区</label></div><div class="canvas-wrap"><canvas id="view"></canvas></div><div id="status" class="status">添加家具后可在俯视图直接拖动，滚轮缩放。空白处拖动可旋转视角。</div></main>
<aside class="right"><section><h2>布局检查</h2><label>目标通行宽度 / 米<input id="clearance" type="number" min=".3" max="2" step=".05" value=".8"></label><button id="check">重新检查</button><p class="hint">这是本次布局的检查参数，可自行调整。按家具外包络和当前门位估算。</p><div id="summary"></div><div id="issues"></div></section><section><h2>放置说明</h2><p class="hint">坐标原点在窗端侧墙 A 的地面角。X 从窗端指向防火门端，Y 指向电梯侧。</p><p class="hint">落地家具保持地面接触，顶装家具贴顶，挂墙家具随所属墙定位。图中的橙色区域表示门前需要预留的位置。</p><p class="notice">房间轮廓采用实测尺寸，门窗仍为待确认候选。此处先做家具功能测试，实际办公室方案需要完整房间信息。</p></section></aside></div>
<script>__FURNITURE_GEOMETRY__</script><script>__ROOM_GEOMETRY__</script><script>const initialScene=__SCENE__;</script><script>__EDITOR_CODE__</script></body></html>
